---

This project is a Rust translation of portions of the Linux kernel networking
stack. The original Linux kernel is licensed under GPLv2. This Rust translation
maintains compatibility with the original kernel's architecture while being
provided under the MIT license for the Rust implementation code.

Linux kernel copyright notices and GPL requirements apply to the original
C implementations that this project translates from.
